{"id":"npc:%E2%80%9C%E7%9D%A6%E7%9A%84%E6%AF%8D%E4%BA%B2%E2%80%9D","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"森南（森美奈美），实力派演员。在若叶睦的梦境中，为她与睦关系亲密，是睦所渴望的理想母亲形象。实际上是众多“睦”人格之一所扮演，目的是将睦永远留在幸福的梦境中，并实现所有人格的价值。视不速之客的祥子为需要清除的威胁。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情SS-5 通往舞会的邀请函。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/c/ce/Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_1939_1$1.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_05_end","lineCount":1,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":135,"line":136,"speaker":"“睦的母亲”","text":"这里是“我们”的梦。"}]}]}